 R←Test_API_003(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "Pause" in ⎕SE
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 :If batchFlag
     R←T._NoBatchTest ⋄ →0
 :EndIf

 →T.PassesIf ∆Ref2CommTools.Pause'This is called via the API'
